{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-09",
  "title": "徹入骨髓",
  "storyCode": "4-9",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "be2392a9c325720a4eddd1c603c8056c760cc46217d60561ac1274c5af0612ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霜葉，小心！別衝那麼前！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道自己在做什麼——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，唔唔額！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寒氣切開了盾牌？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什，什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭！霜葉打亂敵陣，衝向敵方指揮官了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "狙擊幹員，術師幹員，掩護霜葉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想做什麼呢，小狐狸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要你贖罪，要你痛哭流涕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——要你的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擋路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑，黑色的法術......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想和梅菲斯特的手下一個下場......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅菲斯特，看你還能逃到哪裡去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦。看來這些傢伙還不足以攔住你們羅德島嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為你的所作所為付出代價吧，殘忍的傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你逃不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小狐狸，你離我離得，有點近哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我就是將手刃你的那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不尊重生命的人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不配擁有生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會，我的腳——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭！各個方向都出現了整合運動的敵人！雖然數量不多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了，是雪怪小隊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雪怪小隊......聚攏起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，得向你們介紹一位新朋友才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼~接下來，請熱烈歡迎我們這個舞台的真正主角——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西北凍原的噩夢，雪怪們的公主——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————霜————星————小————姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她會把你們的血肉，一點一滴的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全·都·凍·成·碎·渣·哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————糟了！————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——梅菲斯特————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我該先把你這個連野獸都不如的殺人狂，丟在雪原裡等死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊呀，好可怕好可怕~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但羅德島在那邊哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霜葉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，帶她們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個是......那個是——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......向我們走過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不可能贏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......雖然感覺還沒活夠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能遇見你們，我已經很開心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霜葉？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會讓你們死的毫無痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
